atic\"]},\"gemini\":{\"remedies\":[{\"name\":\"Lachesis mutus\",\"match_percentage\":90,\"potency\":\"200C\",\"reasoning\":\"The patient experiences throat pain, particularly upon waking, which is a strong keynote for Lachesis. The history of recurrent sore throats, lasting longer this time, also points towards a deeper constitutional issue that Lachesis can address. The chilly thermal state is also consistent, though Lachesis can have varied thermal states. The duration of the complaint and its persistent nature are key indicators.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"sore throat\",\"throat pain while getting up from sleep\",\"chilly\",\"occurs every two months but this time it lasted longer\"],\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Hepar sulphuris calcareum\",\"match_percentage\":85,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Hepar sulph is indicated for sore throats that are worse from cold air and are associated with a chilly disposition. The pain upon waking can also be present. The recurrent nature of the sore throat suggests a need for a remedy that addresses the underlying susceptibility to infections, which Hepar sulph is known for. The \'cold\' as an exciting cause is a strong pointer.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"sore throat\",\"throat pain while getting up from sleep\",\"chilly\",\"Causation \\/ Exciting Cause: Cold\"],\"reference\":\"Boenninghausen\'s Materia Medica & Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Mercurius solubilis\",\"match_percentage\":80,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Mercurius is a prominent remedy for sore throats, especially those that are worse at night and upon waking. The pain can be described as burning or stitching. While the patient is described as chilly, Mercurius can also have a general aggravation from warmth of the bed. The recurrent nature of the complaint and the duration are also suggestive.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"sore throat\",\"throat pain while getting up from sleep\",\"chilly\"],\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Arseni