y\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Headache that is worse from the slightest motion, often described as bursting or splitting. The patient desires to lie perfectly still. While the thermal state is \'hot\', Bryonia can have heat with dryness. The thirstless state is a key feature.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"headache (Intensity: severe)\",\"Thirst: thirstless\"],\"reference\":\"Allen\'s Keynotes\"},{\"name\":\"Natrum muriaticum\",\"match_percentage\":70,\"potency\":\"200C\",\"reasoning\":\"Headaches often occur in individuals who are sensitive and may have a history of grief or suppressed emotions. The headache can be hammering or bursting, often in the forehead or temples. The thirstless state is a prominent characteristic. The \'hot\' thermal state can be present, but Nat-m is also known for feeling chilly.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"headache (Intensity: severe)\",\"Thirst: thirstless\"],\"reference\":\"Hahnemann\'s Organon of Medicine\"},{\"name\":\"Spigelia\",\"match_percentage\":65,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Primarily indicated for left-sided headaches, especially in the forehead, temples, or around the eyes. The pain is often sharp, stitching, or bursting. Can be associated with throbbing. The \'hot\' thermal state might be present. The thirstless state is not as prominent but can be observed.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"headache (Intensity: severe)\",\"Thermal State: hot\"],\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Repertory\"}]',NULL,NULL,'dual_rag_gemini',NULL,'2025-12-15 13:46:34'),(20,7,1,'Dual AI analysis (RAG + Gemini)','{\"success\":true,\"patient\":{\"name\":\"Muhamd\",\"age\":55,\"gender\":\"male\",\"chief_complaint\":\"Chief Complaint *\"},\"rag\":{\"remedies\":[{\"name\":\"Belladonna\",\"common_name\":\"Deadly Nightshade\",\"match_percentage\":95,\"potency\":\"200C\",\"score\":64,\"reasoning\":\"Matches: headache, ache. Found in: clinical indications. Repertory: Pain, headache (Grade 3); Pain, headache (Grade 3); Headache, bursting (Grade 3)\",\"reference\":\"Allen\