d on symptom totality\\n\\u2022 Ammonium Muriaticum: Consider if mental\\/emotional symptoms are more prominent\\n\\u2022 Actaea Racemosa: Alternative if modalities suggest better fit\\n\\n**Treatment Recommendation:**\\nStart with Chamomilla 30C\\nWait 7-14 days before repeating or changing remedy\\nMonitor for amelioration pattern and any aggravation\\n\\n**Note:** These suggestions are based on database repertory matching. Clinical judgment and detailed case-taking remain essential.\",\"cautions\":\"Start with lowest effective potency and observe response\\nIf symptoms worsen or no improvement in 48-72 hours, reassess case\\nThese suggestions support, but do not replace, professional clinical judgment\",\"total_remedies_searched\":409,\"search_terms\":[\"pain\",\"lumbar\",\"region\",\"cant\",\"sit\",\"long\",\"time\",\"rising\",\"sitting\",\"walking\"]},\"gemini\":{\"remedies\":[{\"name\":\"Rhus toxicodendron\",\"match_percentage\":90,\"potency\":\"200C\",\"reasoning\":\"Classic remedy for stiffness and pain that is worse on first motion and better by continued motion. The aggravation on rising from sitting and amelioration by walking strongly points to Rhus tox. The desire to lie down for relief also fits.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"lumbar pain\",\"worse on rising from sitting\",\"better by walking\",\"better by lying down\"],\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Bryonia alba\",\"match_percentage\":80,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Bryonia is known for pain that is worse from the slightest motion and better by absolute rest. While the patient finds walking better, the aggravation on rising from sitting (a form of motion) and the desire to lie down could align with Bryonia if the pain is sharp and stabbing, and the patient is generally irritable and wants to be left alone.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"lumbar pain\",\"worse on rising from sitting\",\"better by lying down\"],\"reference\":\"Boenninghausen\'s Materia Medica & Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"L