ic, and if cold applications would provide relief (though not explicitly stated, it\'s a strong characteristic).\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"lumbar pain\",\"worse on rising from sitting\",\"better by lying down\"],\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Apis mellifica\",\"match_percentage\":70,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Apis is indicated for stinging, burning pains that are often worse from heat and better from cold. If the lumbar pain has a stinging or burning quality, and the patient feels generally better from pressure or cold, Apis could be considered. The aggravation on rising from sitting and relief by lying down might be present.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"lumbar pain\",\"worse on rising from sitting\",\"better by lying down\"],\"reference\":\"Boenninghausen\'s Materia Medica & Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Nux vomica\",\"match_percentage\":65,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Nux vomica is often indicated for back pain, especially in individuals with sedentary lifestyles or those who have overexerted themselves. The pain can be worse in the morning and after sitting. The aggravation on rising from sitting and relief by lying down could fit. However, the amelioration by walking is less characteristic of Nux vomica, which typically prefers rest.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"lumbar pain\",\"worse on rising from sitting\",\"cannot sit for long time\",\"better by lying down\"],\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Repertory\"}]',NULL,NULL,'dual_rag_gemini',NULL,'2025-12-22 09:59:54'),(56,18,11,'Dual AI analysis (RAG + Gemini)','{\"success\":true,\"patient\":{\"name\":\"Manish\",\"age\":31,\"gender\":\"male\",\"chief_complaint\":\"allergic rhinitis more when exposed to dust\"},\"rag\":{\"remedies\":[{\"name\":\"Ambrosia Artemisifolia\",\"common_name\":\"Ragweed\",\"match_percentage\":95,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":10,\"reasoning\":\"Hay fever with intolerable itching of eyelids\",\"reference\":\"Boericke; Murphy; Boericke\'s Materia Medica\",\"matched_terms\":[\"allergic\",\"rhinitis\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"clinical\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Hay fever with intolerable itching of eyelids. Wheezing respiration. Stuffed nose.\"},{\"name\":\"Sabadilla\",\"common_name\":\"Cevadilla Seed\",\"match_percentage\":85,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":10,\"reasoning\":\"Hay fever, violent sneezing, itching palate, sensitive to garlic odor Hay fever, allergic rhinitis, worms, sore throat\",\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Lectures on Materia Medica, p.1133-1142; Boericke\'s Materia Medica\",\"matched_terms\":[\"allergic\",\"rhinitis\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"clinical\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Hay fever, violent sneezing, itching palate, sensitive to garlic odor\"},{\"name\":\"Hedera Helix\",\"common_name\":\"Common Ivy\",\"match_percentage\":75,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":10,\"reasoning\":\"This remedy correlates with the case through its keynote symptoms and clinical indications\",\"reference\":\"Boericke Materia Medica, p.260; Allen\'s Keynotes\",\"matched_terms\":[\"rhinitis\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"keynotes\",\"clinical\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Rhinitis. Catarrhal affections.\"},{\"name\":\"Alphitobius Diaperinus\",\"common_name\":\"Lesser Mealworm\",\"match_percentage\":60,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":8,\"reasoning\":\"Respiratory problems in confined spaces\",\"reference\":\"Modern Provings; Allen\'s Keynotes\",\"matched_terms\":[\"allergic\",\"dust\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"keynotes\",\"modalities\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Allergic reactions. Respiratory problems in confined spaces.\"},{\"name\":\"Culex Musca\",\"common_name\":\"Mosquito\",\"match_percentage\":45,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":6,\"reasoning\":\"Allergic reactions to bites\",\"reference\":\"Murphy Lotus Materia Medica; Allen\'s Keynotes\",\"matched_terms\":[\"allergic\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"keynotes\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Allergic reactions to bites.\"}],\"case_analysis\":\"**Case Analysis:**\\nChief Complaint: allergic rhinitis more when exposed to dust\\nTotal symptoms analyzed: 0\\n\\n**Repertorial Analysis:**\\nPrimary remedy indicated: **Ambrosia Artemisifolia** with 95% correlation.\\n\\n**Differential Diagnosis:**\\n\\u2022 Ambrosia Artemisifolia: Strongest match based on symptom totality\\n\\u2022 Sabadilla: Consider if mental\\/emotional symptoms are more prominent\\n\\u2022 Hedera Helix: Alternative if modalities suggest better fit\\n\\n**Treatment Recommendation:**\\nStart with Ambrosia Artemisifolia 30C\\nWait 7-14 days before repeating or changing remedy\\nMonitor for amelioration pattern and any aggravation\\n\\n**Note:** These suggestions are based on database repertory matching. Clinical judgment and detailed case-taking remain essential.\",\"cautions\":\"Start with lowest effective potency and observe response\\nIf symptoms worsen or no improvement in 48-72 hours, reassess case\\nThese suggestions support, but do not replace, professional clinical judgment\",\"total_remedies_searched\":9,\"search_terms\":[\"allergic\",\"rhinitis\",\"exposed\",\"dust\"]},\"gemini\":{\"remedies\":[{\"name\":\"Arsenicum album\",\"match_percentage\":90,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Strong affinity for dust allergies, with symptoms of burning, itching, sneezing, and watery discharge that is often acrid. Restlessness and anxiety are also characteristic. The patient\'s complaint is specifically triggered by dust.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"burning sensation\",\"itching\",\"sneezing\",\"watery discharge\",\"acrid discharge\",\"restlessness\",\"anxiety\"],\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Pulsatilla\",\"match_percentage\":80,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Pulsatilla is indicated for bland, watery discharges, often worse in a warm room and better in open air. While not as strongly linked to dust as Arsenicum, it can be considered if the discharge is not acrid and the patient seeks open air for relief. Emotional symptoms like weepiness can also be present.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"watery discharge\",\"bland discharge\",\"worse in warm room\",\"better in open air\"],\"reference\":\"Boenninghausen\'s Materia Medica & Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Sabadilla\",\"match_percentage\":85,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"This remedy is highly specific for sneezing, especially from dust or hay. The sneezing is often violent and in paroxysms, with a watery coryza. Tickling in the nose is a key symptom.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"violent sneezing\",\"sneezing in paroxysms\",\"watery coryza\",\"tickling in nose\"],\"reference\":\"Allen\'s Keynotes\"},{\"name\":\"Naphthalinum\",\"match_percentage\":75,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Naphthalinum is known for its action on the respiratory tract and is often indicated in cases of rhinitis triggered by irritants like dust. Symptoms can include sneezing, watery discharge, and a feeling of dryness or irritation in the nasal passages.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"sneezing\",\"watery discharge\",\"dryness in nose\",\"irritation in nose\"],\"reference\":\"Hering\'s Guiding Symptoms of Our Materia Medica\"},{\"name\":\"Euphrasia officinalis\",\"match_percentage\":70,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Euphrasia is characterized by burning and watery eyes with bland nasal discharge, or vice versa. If the eye symptoms are prominent alongside the rhinitis triggered by dust, this remedy should be considered. The discharge is typically acrid from the eyes and bland from the nose.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"burning eyes\",\"watery eyes\",\"bland nasal discharge\"],\"reference\":\"Boenninghausen\'s Materia Medica & Repertory\"}],\"case_analysis\":\"The primary complaint is allergic rhinitis, specifically triggered by exposure to dust. This points towards remedies with a strong affinity for irritants and the mucous membranes of the nose. The key is the specific modality of \'exposure to dust\'.\",\"cautions\":\"It is crucial to gather more detailed information about the nature of the discharge (acrid\\/bland, color), accompanying symptoms (sneezing, itching, burning, watery eyes, headache, general modalities like temperature, time of day, and emotional state) to precisely select the most indicated remedy. A thorough case-taking is essential for accurate prescription. If symptoms persist or worsen, consult a qualified homeopathic practitioner.\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash-lite\"}}','[{\"name\":\"Ambrosia Artemisifolia\",\"common_name\":\"Ragweed\",\"match_percentage\":95,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":10,\"reasoning\":\"Hay fever with intolerable itching of eyelids\",\"reference\":\"Boericke; Murphy; Boericke\'s Materia Medica\",\"matched_terms\":[\"allergic\",\"rhinitis\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"clinical\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Hay fever with intolerable itching of eyelids. Wheezing respiration. Stuffed nose.\"},{\"name\":\"Sabadilla\",\"common_name\":\"Cevadilla Seed\",\"match_percentage\":85,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":10,\"reasoning\":\"Hay fever, violent sneezing, itching palate, sensitive to garlic odor Hay fever, allergic rhinitis, worms, sore throat\",\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Lectures on Materia Medica, p.1133-1142; Boericke\'s Materia Medica\",\"matched_terms\":[\"allergic\",\"rhinitis\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"clinical\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Hay fever, violent sneezing, itching palate, sensitive to garlic odor\"},{\"name\":\"Hedera Helix\",\"common_name\":\"Common Ivy\",\"match_percentage\":75,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":10,\"reasoning\":\"This remedy correlates with the case through its keynote symptoms and clinical indications\",\"reference\":\"Boericke Materia Medica, p.260; Allen\'s Keynotes\",\"matched_terms\":[\"rhinitis\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"keynotes\",\"clinical\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Rhinitis. Catarrhal affections.\"},{\"name\":\"Alphitobius Diaperinus\",\"common_name\":\"Lesser Mealworm\",\"match_percentage\":60,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":8,\"reasoning\":\"Respiratory problems in confined spaces\",\"reference\":\"Modern Provings; Allen\'s Keynotes\",\"matched_terms\":[\"allergic\",\"dust\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"keynotes\",\"modalities\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Allergic reactions. Respiratory problems in confined spaces.\"},{\"name\":\"Culex Musca\",\"common_name\":\"Mosquito\",\"match_percentage\":45,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"score\":6,\"reasoning\":\"Allergic reactions to bites\",\"reference\":\"Murphy Lotus Materia Medica; Allen\'s Keynotes\",\"matched_terms\":[\"allergic\"],\"matched_fields\":[\"keynotes\"],\"matching_symptoms\":[],\"repertory_rubrics\":[],\"keynote_excerpt\":\"Allergic reactions to bites.\"},{\"name\":\"Arsenicum album\",\"match_percentage\":90,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Strong affinity for dust allergies, with symptoms of burning, itching, sneezing, and watery discharge that is often acrid. Restlessness and anxiety are also characteristic. The patient\'s complaint is specifically triggered by dust.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"burning sensation\",\"itching\",\"sneezing\",\"watery discharge\",\"acrid discharge\",\"restlessness\",\"anxiety\"],\"reference\":\"Kent\'s Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Pulsatilla\",\"match_percentage\":80,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Pulsatilla is indicated for bland, watery discharges, often worse in a warm room and better in open air. While not as strongly linked to dust as Arsenicum, it can be considered if the discharge is not acrid and the patient seeks open air for relief. Emotional symptoms like weepiness can also be present.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"watery discharge\",\"bland discharge\",\"worse in warm room\",\"better in open air\"],\"reference\":\"Boenninghausen\'s Materia Medica & Repertory\"},{\"name\":\"Sabadilla\",\"match_percentage\":85,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"This remedy is highly specific for sneezing, especially from dust or hay. The sneezing is often violent and in paroxysms, with a watery coryza. Tickling in the nose is a key symptom.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"violent sneezing\",\"sneezing in paroxysms\",\"watery coryza\",\"tickling in nose\"],\"reference\":\"Allen\'s Keynotes\"},{\"name\":\"Naphthalinum\",\"match_percentage\":75,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Naphthalinum is known for its action on the respiratory tract and is often indicated in cases of rhinitis triggered by irritants like dust. Symptoms can include sneezing, watery discharge, and a feeling of dryness or irritation in the nasal passages.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"sneezing\",\"watery discharge\",\"dryness in nose\",\"irritation in nose\"],\"reference\":\"Hering\'s Guiding Symptoms of Our Materia Medica\"},{\"name\":\"Euphrasia officinalis\",\"match_percentage\":70,\"potency\":\"30C\",\"reasoning\":\"Euphrasia is characterized by burning and watery eyes with bland nasal discharge, or vice versa. If the eye symptoms are prominent alongside the rhinitis triggered by dust, this remedy should be considered. The discharge is typically acrid from the eyes and bland from the nose.\",\"matching_symptoms\":[\"allergic rhinitis\",\"exposure to dust\",\"burning eyes\",\"watery eyes\",\"bland nasal discharge\"],\"reference\":\"Boenninghausen\'s Materia Medica & Repertory\"}]',NULL,NULL,'dual_rag_gemini',NULL,'2025-12-22 10:00:35');
